407
00:24:23,059 --> 00:24:23,420
olunca.

408
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:25,200
Tabi

409
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:25,720
kendisi

410
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:26,299
dominant

411
00:24:26,299 --> 00:24:27,339
Özal'ın.

412
00:24:28,139 --> 00:24:29,259
İki görevi de

413
00:24:29,259 --> 00:24:29,879
