417
00:24:31,740 --> 00:24:32,259
Onun yerine

418
00:24:32,259 --> 00:24:32,759
son derece

419
00:24:32,759 --> 00:24:33,960
pasif bir

420
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:34,400
